1088:\subsection{Well-behaved approximate cycle decompositions} \label{subsection:wellbehaved}
1090:In this section we show the existence of approximate cycle decomposition which are `well-behaved', meaning that the subgraph left by the uncovered edges has small codegree.
1091:The argument is different depending on the two setting considered by Theorem~\ref{theorem:ldecomposcodegree}, and we start with the former.
1093:When $\ell$ is divisible by $3$, the tight cycle $C_{\ell}$ is $3$-partite.
1095:This allows us to find an approximate decomposition of any $3$-graph $H$ with copies of $C_{\ell}$ if $\ell$ is divisible by~$3$, simply by removing copies of $C_{\ell}$ greedily until $o(n^3)$ edges remain. 
