1115:In this range we exploit the connection of \emph{fractional graph decompositions} with their integral counterparts.
1116:Given a $3$-graph $H$, let $\mathcal{C}_{\ell}(H)$ be the family of all $\ell$-cycles in $H$, and given $X \in E(H)$ let $\mathcal{C}_{\ell}(H, X) \subseteq \mathcal{C}_{\ell}(H)$ be those cycles which use  the edge $X$.
